          <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Get ad group analytics Get analytics for the specified ad groups in the specified &#x60;ad_account_id&#x60;, filtered by the specified options.  - The token&#39;s user_account must either be the Owner of the specified ad account, or have one of the necessary roles granted to them via [Business Access](https://help.pinterest.com/en/business/article/share-and-manage-access-to-your-ad-accounts): Admin, Analyst, Campaign Manager. - If granularity is not HOUR, you can pull data from up to 90 days before the current date in UTC time, with a maximum time range of 90 days. - If granularity is HOUR, you can pull data from up to 8 days before the current date in UTC time, with a maximum time range of 3 days.</stringProp>
