          <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Get targeting analytics for ad groups Get targeting analytics for one or more ad groups. For the requested ad group(s) and metrics, the response will include the requested metric information (e.g. SPEND_IN_DOLLAR) for the requested target type (e.g. \&quot;age_bucket\&quot;) for applicable values (e.g. \&quot;45-49\&quot;).  - The token&#39;s user_account must either be the Owner of the specified ad account, or have one of the necessary roles granted to them via [Business Access](https://help.pinterest.com/en/business/article/share-and-manage-access-to-your-ad-accounts): Admin, Analyst, Campaign Manager. - If granularity is not HOUR, you can pull data from up to 90 days before the current date in UTC time, with a maximum time range of 90 days. - If granularity is HOUR, you can pull data from up to 8 days before the current date in UTC time, with a maximum time range of 3 days.</stringProp>
